Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: complete A14 v2 board backport

Remaining changes from Bjorn Andersson's supplied v2 DTS, posted base
68142f986ff04b2b70b31db00f719bf690f64a9a. Applied after stage1.
Keep local regulator labels, USB/SCMI/display workarounds and HDMI audio.
Keep explicit QCC2072 Bluetooth identification with the new UART graph;
the pinned M.2 dynamic Bluetooth-ID table lacks this card.
Label the privacy LED for our optional V4L2 sensor.

